TI  - Mapping forest fine-grained soil particle size distributions: a holistic GeoAI approach via graph neural networks, LiDAR, and Sentinel-2
PY  - 2025
T2  - International Journal of Applied Earth Observation and Geoinformation
VL  - 143
C7  - 104807
DO  - 10.1016/j.jag.2025.104807
