AB  - The article presents the results of research into the intelligent transformation of multiaspect geoinformation models by integrating artificial intelligence. The development of GeoAI is discussed, and a comparative analysis of geographic artificial intelligence and traditional multiaspect geoinformation models is provided. The concept of a spatial cyber-physical environment is introduced. It is shown that the formation of a unified geoinformation space requires the creation of models and technologies that fully meet the requirements of Web 3.0 and Web 4.0 concepts. © 2026 IEEE.
