TI  - GeoAI for Driving Risk Assessment via Vision-Language Models: A Knowledge Guided RAG System and Dual Evaluation
PY  - 2025
T2  - GeoAI 2025 - Proceedings of the 8th ACM SIGSPATIAL International Workshop on AI for Geographic Knowledge Discovery
SP  - 161
