AB  - Hydrographic offices and maritime authorities are facing unprecedented challenges: growing data volumes, tighter timelines and increasing demands for accuracy and interoperability. Traditional workflows, while reliable, often struggle to keep pace with the complexity of modern hydrospatial environments. By integrating geospatial AI in a GIS, maritime authorities can advance their mission in supporting navigation, promoting resilience and advancing the blue economy. © 2026, Geomatics Information and Trading Centre B.V.. All rights reserved
