TI  - FROM POSTFACTUM TO ANTEFACTUM GEOGRAPHY: WHAT ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE WOULD HAVE CHANGED IN SEVEN EARLIER STUDIES A Retrospective Human–AI Experiment in Technical Geography
PY  - 2026
