TI  - GeoJSON agents: a multi-agent LLM architecture for geospatial analysis—function calling vs. code generation
PY  - 2026
T2  - Big Earth Data
DO  - 10.1080/20964471.2026.2615511
UR  - https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/105027886515?origin=resultslist
