TI  - A Spatial Mismatch Analysis of Blue–Green–Gray Infrastructure for Urban Cooling: Linking Supply, Thermal Pressure, and Heat-Sensitive Demand
PY  - 2026
T2  - Land
VL  - 15
IS  - 7
C7  - 1296
