TI  - An Operational Ethical Framework for GeoAI: A PRISMA-Based Systematic Review of International Policy and Scholarly Literature
PY  - 2026
T2  - ISPRS International Journal of Geo-Information
VL  - 15
IS  - 1
C7  - 51
DO  - 10.3390/ijgi15010051
