TI  - A Novel Geospatial Methodology for Measuring and Mapping Spatiotemporal Built-Up Dynamics Based on Google Earth Engine and Unsupervised K-Means Clustering of Multispectral Satellite Imagery
PY  - 2024
T2  - 2024 IEEE International Workshop on Metrology for Living Environment, MetroLivEnv 2024 - Proceedings
SP  - 57
