AB  - Although studies applying artificial intelligence technologies to geographic problems date back to the 1980s, Geospatial Artificial Intelligence (GeoAI) continues to emerge as one of the fastest-developing research directions in spatial data science and geography today. In this chapter, we first review the recent GeoAI research advancements in various geospatial subdomains. We further discuss several important future research directions of GeoAI. We hope this chapter can provide a meaningful overview of the research landscape of GeoAI. © The Author(s), under exclusive license to Springer Nature Switzerland AG 2025.
