UR  - https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/0028045851?origin=resultslist
AD  - Lab MASI Universite P. et M. Curie, Paris, France
AB  - An open queueing network system of N nodes with Geo(Ai) input and Geo(Si) service at every node is studied. Here Geo(Ai), Geo(Si) mean compound geometric. First we are interested in the cases of eventual independent departure from every node as isolated queueing system Geo(Ai)/Geo(Si)/1. Then we look for a configuration of the network which is product form solution compatible. At last, the necessary and sufficient condition for an open Markovian queueing network of N nodes to have solution of product form is proved. A certain number of open Markovian queueing networks which have solution of product form are found.
