TI  - AtlasHDF: An Efficient Big Data Framework for GeoAI
PY  - 2022
T2  - Proceedings of the 10th ACM SIGSPATIAL International Workshop on Analytics for Big Geospatial Data, BigSpatial 2022
SP  - 1
EP  - 7
DO  - 10.1145/3557917.3567615
